00:21:01,320 --> 00:21:04,620
- Hey, hey. Who'd you miss the most? - Monica.
-嘿，你最想念誰呢？ -摩妮卡

298
00:21:05,660 --> 00:21:07,680
Gotcha.
知道了

299
00:21:10,230 --> 00:21:14,690
- I never want to leave you again. - I thought if you left, you'd get fired.
-我再也不要離開你了 -我以為如果你走了會被炒魷魚的

300
00:21:14,900 --> 00:21:18,360
Turns out they can't fire me. Because I quit.
他們沒有辦法炒我魷魚的 因為我不幹了

301
00:21:18,740 --> 00:21:22,300
- What? - What? You..? You really quit your job?
-什麼？ -什麼？你？你真的辭職了？

302
00:21:22,510 --> 00:21:25,970
Yeah. It was a stupid job, and I could not stand leaving you.
是的，那是份愚蠢的工作 而我無法忍受離開你

303
00:21:26,250 --> 00:21:29,980
Why should I be the only one who doesn't do what he really wants to do?
我為什麼要當那個唯一 必須做他不想要做的事的人？

304
00:21:30,180 --> 00:21:35,120
- Well, what do you really wanna do? - I have not thought this through.
-那你真的想做什麼呢？ -這件事我沒想清楚

305
00:21:35,760 --> 00:21:39,250
- Oh, my God. - I know. I should've talked to you first.
-喔！我的天！ -我知道，我應該先跟你討論的

306
00:21:39,490 --> 00:21:42,660
No, I think that this is what you wanna do. I think it's great!
不，我想如果這是你想要的 我認為這很棒！

307
00:21:43,560 --> 00:21:45,430
Thanks.
謝謝

308
00:21:45,670 --> 00:21:50,730
Chandler, your being here is the best Christmas present I could ever imagine.
錢德，你能夠在這裡 是我有過最棒的聖誕禮物了

309
00:21:52,270 --> 00:21:54,760
- Now give me my real gift. - Yeah.
-現在給我真正的禮物 -好

310
00:21:54,940 --> 00:21:57,000
- Thank you. - Here, pass those around.
-謝謝 -這裡，分給大家

311
00:22:05,390 --> 00:22:09,690
"A donation has been made in your name to the New York City Ballet."
「一項捐款已經以您的名義 捐贈給紐約市立芭蕾舞團」

312
00:22:11,430 --> 00:22:13,760
How did you know?
你怎麼會知道我要這個呢？

313
00:22:13,930 --> 00:22:17,920
What? Are you kidding? I can't return this.
什麼？你在開玩笑嗎？ 我不能退還這個的

314
00:22:19,100 --> 00:22:21,290
It's time we started thinking about other people.
該是我們關懷別人的時候了

315
00:22:21,470 --> 00:22:24,100
And besides, this gift still says, "I love you guys."
除此之外，這份禮物還包含了 「我愛你們」

316
00:22:24,300 --> 00:22:28,100
- Mine says, "To Lillian Myers." - I don't have a job.
-我的上面寫「給莉莉安邁爾」 -我可是失業了

317
00:22:32,980 --> 00:22:35,570
Actuary? No.
精算師？不

318
00:22:35,920 --> 00:22:39,080
Bookkeeper? No.
簿記員？不

319
00:22:39,250 --> 00:22:41,850
Topless dancer?
上空舞者？

320
00:22:47,260 --> 00:22:50,790
Hey, you know what I just realized? You are the sole wage earner.
嗨，你知道我剛剛才想通什麼嗎？ 你是家裡唯一收入來源

321
00:22:50,960 --> 00:22:56,460
You are the head of the household. I don't do anything. I'm a kept man!
你是這個家的戶長 我什麼都沒做，我是被供養的小白臉！

322
00:22:56,670 --> 00:22:58,160
You are.
沒錯

323
00:22:58,370 --> 00:22:59,770
Honey, here's 20 bucks.
親愛的，這裡有二十塊

324
00:23:00,070 --> 00:23:02,670
Go buy yourself something pretty while I'm at work tomorrow.
我明天去上班的時候 你去買一些漂亮的東西

325
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


326
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
